config BR2_PACKAGE_LINUX_SMP
	bool "linux-smp"
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	help
	  The multi-hart kernel of rv32-nexysa7100, whose bitstream is built
	  with the define CPU_COUNT from 1 to 4, and ATOMIC_COHERENCE=1 from
	  2 harts: the sources and patches of the package linux, its
	  configuration linux.config merged with linux-smp.config; its Image
	  is installed to images/smp/.

comment "linux-smp needs the Linux kernel"
	depends on !BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
